      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open room info",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In your room, tap its name or the i at the top. <strong>Room info</strong> shows the topic, what you can change and the members.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/67777d12934632b1.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Rename it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Rename room</strong>, type the new name and tap <strong>SAVE</strong>. Change topic works the same way, but a new topic may show only when you open Room info again.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/267634b014206262.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Give someone a role",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap a member, then <strong>Make moderator</strong> or <strong>Make admin</strong>. The new role shows the next time you open Room info.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/93bed6b7adf3af16.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Remove someone",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap a member and pick Remove from room. Confirm with <strong>REMOVE</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/48f8acbcbadbc0b1.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Close the room",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>A room cannot be deleted, so tap <strong>Remove from</strong> your space and <strong>REMOVE</strong>. Then tap <strong>Leave room</strong> and confirm, and ask the others to leave as well.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/c87337151354a0c5.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
